<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Resources appoints new MD.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Resources appoints new MD.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold producer Australian Resources Ltd said on Tuesday it had appointed acting chief executive Robert Ryan as managing director and elected director Philip Pearce as chairman.</p>
<p>Former Chairman John Roberts has stepped down, it said.</p>
<p>Ryan replaces Richard Windsor, who announced last year he would retire at the end of February.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
